<li><a class="" href="#password-authentication-failed-for-user">Password authentication failed for user</a></li>
<li><a class="" href="#couldnt-connect-to-compute-node">Couldn&#x27;t connect to compute node</a></li>
<li><a class="" href="#cant-reach-database-server">Can&#x27;t reach database server</a></li>
<li><a class="" href="#error-undefined-database-error">Error undefined: Database error</a></li>
