 connecting to your database from an application or client such as \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"psql\"}],\", letting the connection remain idle until the compute suspends, and then running a query from the same connection.\"]}]\n9a:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"If you encounter this error, you can try adjusting the timing of your query or reestablishing the connection before running the query. Alternatively, if you are on a paid plan, you can disable scale to zero. For instructions, see \",[\"$\",\"$L62\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/guides/scale-to-zero-guide\",\"children\":\"Configuring scale to zero for Neon computes\"}],\". \",[\"$\",\"$L62\",null,{\"href\":\"/docs/introduction/plans\",\"children\":\"Free plan\"}],\" users cannot disable scale to zero.\"]}]\n9b:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"unsupported-startup-parameter\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Unsupported startup parameter\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden\",\"href\":\"#unsupported-startup-parameter\",\"aria-label\":\"Link to Unsupported startup parameter\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":14,\"height\":14,\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 14 14\",\"className\":\"inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5\",\"children\":\"$64:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n9c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This error is reported in two variations:\"}]\n9f:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"The error occurs when using a pooled Neon connection string with startup options that are not supported by PgBouncer. PgBouncer allows only startup parameters it can keep track of in startup packets. These includ